        <item>
            <title>0.3.12</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:35:59 +0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>518</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.12</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Start a session from the notch, and copy what the agent said

- Command+Option+N, or New session in the list, starts a session in Claude, Codex or your terminal while you stay where you were
- What the agent said, on the card or in a reply, can be selected and copied with Command+C
- A card with words selected stays open, so you can copy at your own pace
- After an update, a What's new card says what changed
- Highlights in the list and in Settings follow the pointer and never stay lit after it leaves
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/asafofer/perch-releases/releases/download/v0.3.12/Perch-0.3.12.zip" length="3042183" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="L+xBDphTGjBXx2/qXtBi3Fro8qSpAeEqnY0LNg6H6DEBQsUUnn3m/jj/Qf1S3RHCodUpzWhsrf1g+D72ORelAA=="/>
